# Phase 5: generated 16-bit PNG cache is regenerable byte-identically from
# dataset/raw + configs/preprocessing_config.yaml + src/preprocessing/pipeline.py.
# Deterministic cache metadata (per-split provenance.csv + cache_summary.json)
# IS tracked; only the image PNGs are ignored.
data/processed/*/*.png

# Phase 6: the training decode cache (experiments/baseline_results/_cache/*.npy,
# ~1.27 GB) is derived data regenerable byte-identically from the Phase 5 cache
# + the frozen manifests + seed 20260918; only experiment records are tracked.
experiments/baseline_results/_cache/

# Phase 6 scratch: per-epoch console logs and the temporary one-epoch training
# runner. Their authoritative content is preserved in the committed experiment
# artifacts (train_log.csv / metrics.json); the raw scratch is regenerable
# session output, not evidence.
/_p6_*.log
/_p6_b4_epoch_tmp.py
